        {
          "text": " Ebala kwanata EJAKAIT asurokin iidunyetaka kere lueroko, luetirorete airumet naesurumit eoŋ ikatuŋa Isirael ebe: “Koany, arutori kes kakwapukee, arutori da ekek loka Yuda kokidinikec. ",
